sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 用户钱包
    participant Order as order服务
    participant KNew as Kafka orders.new
    participant KCancel as Kafka orders.cancel
    participant Match as matching引擎
    participant WAL as WAL
    participant Book as 订单簿
    participant KFill as Kafka fills.pending
    participant Exec as execution
    participant Geth as go-ethereum
    participant Perp as Perpetual
    participant Dealer as Dealer
    participant KDone as Kafka fills.confirmed

    User->>Order: POST order + Signature
    Order->>Order: Verify EIP-712 + 过期检查
    Order->>KNew: MsgNewOrder

    Note over Match: Recover WAL

    KNew->>Match: consume
    Match->>WAL: Append Order
    Match->>Book: Match taker
    Match->>KFill: MsgPendingFill
    Match->>Book: 剩余挂单

    KCancel->>Match: Cancel
    Match->>WAL: Append Cancel

    KFill->>Exec: consume
    Exec->>Geth: Trade executor密钥
    Geth->>Perp: trade
    Perp->>Dealer: approveTrade
    Geth-->>Exec: receipt
    Exec->>KDone: FillResult
